miadi-music-video — music to picture on a Miadi host

This package brings what score videos need as dependencies and installs no
program of its own yet: the engraved page from miadi-music-render, Pillow and
NumPy from miadi-music-measure's venv, ImageMagick, and ffmpeg. The JamAI
score-video tools (jamai-defile, jamai-clip) run on a host that has it.

Install it on a host that makes music for episodes. An album-only host
installs miadi-music without it.
